# Input

```scss
@use   "sass:list";

$ordinary:   column\73/**/(1fr,2fr);
$interpolated:   #{"column"}\73/**/(1fr,2fr);

.deferred{ordinary:list.length($ordinary);interpolated:list.length($interpolated)}

```


# Formatted

```scss
@use "sass:list";

$ordinary: column\73 /**/ (1fr, 2fr);
$interpolated: #{"column"}\73 /**/ (1fr, 2fr);

.deferred {
	ordinary: list.length($ordinary);
	interpolated: list.length($interpolated);
}

```
